    LINE_COMMENT@37..121 "// After the type arguments in a type position, `.` and names continue the type as a"
    NEWLINE@121..122 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@122..215 "// NESTED_TYPE_REF whose first child is the instantiation (grammar.md 1.3): the last name may"
    NEWLINE@215..216 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@216..312 "// have type arguments of its own, and the form repeats (`A<X>.B<Y>.C`). In an expression's type"
    NEWLINE@312..313 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@313..408 "// arguments the same nodes are read. Recovery: no name after `.` is E0405, a missing `>` after"
    NEWLINE@408..409 "\n"
    LINE_COMMENT@409..493 "// the last name is E0400. The names are not declared, so the analysis reports them."
